 The Rise and Fall of Maya Civilization (Norman, Okla.: University of Oklahoma Press, ; originally published in ). Many of Thompson’s ideas have been eclipsed by those of later archaeologists, but the book is still very much worth reading. If only Thompson’s successors had shared his talent for popular writing .

 T. Patrick Culbert, ed.,

