 Lost Kingdoms of the Maya (Washington, D.C.: National Geographic Society, ). A lavishly illustrated view of the Maya by a husbandandwife team of archaeologists. The Stuarts’ son, David, who first visited Mesoamerica at age three, later became a leading scholar of Mayan anthropology .

